        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86081, Solid Brass 12 x 3 Knoxville Pull Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 12 x 3 Knoxville Pull Plate is made out of solid brass and comes with mounting hardware. It is drilled to fit any <a href=\"/collections/emtek-door-pulls-and-push-plates\"><b>Emtek Pull</b></a> with an <b>8 inch center to center</b>. This classic beaded push plate will look stunning in traditional homes and commercial settings. Choose from a wide array of traditional finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Emtek Knoxville Pull Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Holes: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with Mounting Screws</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMt-86082-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262393\"><b>Emtek 86082 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-7-finish.jpg?v=1704354517\" width=\"600\" height=\"115\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
